You could use methylKit for this purpose. But you have to convert the bed file into either GRanges or methylDiff object only (not any other methylKit objects).

To convert bed to GRanges object, you may go through this beautiful resource <http://al2na.github.io/compgenr/genomic_intervals/granges.html> compiled by Altuna. It would not be a nice idea to create a methylDiff object from a bed file for this purpose!

Regards,
Kalyan

